{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"crossbow_steel","model_identifier":"crossbow_steel","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## crossbow_steel\n\nRanged weapon, steel.\n\n- Cubes: 11 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -10.5..10.5, y -3.0..3.0, z -23.0..12.0 (size 21.0 x 6.0 x 35.0 u = 59 x 17 x 98 cm).\nSteel crossbow: heavier, thicker steel prod (21 u wide) lashed to an oak stock, stirrup, trigger lever, and a windlass (crank axle with two cranks and handle bar) on the butt for spanning. Grip at the origin (trigger hand); prod 17 u forward (-Z), windlass at the butt 10-12 u back. Second grip 7.3 u forward (warrior_base crossbow_shoot). Steel and high-quality steel textures.\n- Embedded texture: steel. Tier textures: steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `crossbow_steel_steel.png`, `crossbow_steel_hq_steel.png`\n"},"description":"## crossbow_steel\n\nRanged weapon, steel.\n\n- Cubes: 11 (0 rotated). Texture 64x32, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -10.5..10.5, y -3.0..3.0, z -23.0..12.0 (size 21.0 x 6.0 x 35.0 u = 59 x 17 x 98 cm).\nSteel crossbow: heavier, thicker steel prod (21 u wide) lashed to an oak stock, stirrup, trigger lever, and a windlass (crank axle with two cranks and handle bar) on the butt for spanning. Grip at the origin (trigger hand); prod 17 u forward (-Z), windlass at the butt 10-12 u back. Second grip 7.3 u forward (warrior_base crossbow_shoot). Steel and high-quality steel textures.\n- Embedded texture: steel. Tier textures: steel, hq_steel.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `crossbow_steel_steel.png`, `crossbow_steel_hq_steel.png`\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"stock","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from"